WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.777
An AI draft uses an outdated policy in a customer message.

00:00:04.777 --> 00:00:15.634
The weak instruction says only ‘check the answer.’ The stronger rule names the current approved policy, the human reviewer, and the action when records conflict.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:20.845
Hold the message until the authorized policy owner resolves the source uncertainty.
